{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：19:49 2026-11-25 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"「領袖勁力」大熱開齋\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/a3c0f0b63681328c6498000319d506dd/2026-11/r2_6.jpg\"/>\n<p>徐雨石馬房的「領袖勁力」上季尾至今季連番在四班賽上名後，今晚降五班上陣，且找來潘頓壓陣成為大熱門，終於贏得在港首場頭馬，不過過程並不輕鬆，騎者終點前力策，才能力拒「領航多福」衝刺勝出，今場是季內潘頓和徐雨石首次合作贏馬。</p>\n<p>今晚第二場五班千二米賽事，前新聞女主播周嘉儀的「天下寵兒」列陣，成為焦點，結果於女騎師袁幸堯胯下跑得第四名，而她今晚都有和家人入場為馬匹打氣，賽後周嘉儀用手機拍下馬兒跑完返回來的短片。</p>\n<p>今場頭馬是徐雨石訓練的「領袖勁力」，賽後徐雨石說：「我特登卜定潘頓跑『領袖勁力』，馬兒常常出閘緩慢，所以想潘頓幫手，今場出閘好快，潘頓有一定功勞。我感謝馬主很有耐性，馬兒常常在四班跑得接近，今仗降五班有一定優勢。」</p>\n<h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6e19ac1e126271986c8e2e8021a54a16/2026-11/3f4686c9-26ea-4eca-a2c1-8767db8d3a8c.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d362c42532131fd442b236735ae8cb23/2026-11/4f9540e2-fe1b-452b-a0e5-740172ae2752.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/217baaa358184a04dd41ccb5101f7fb5/2026-11/7d0fbb24-437a-4886-8332-e6220feb062b.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ef882acbfcd486001a16d0792e4cbd4a/2026-11/09a211c6-6085-4343-aa94-e1455be11a59.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a406c65ed5ea6591c66ef3a71485319b/2026-11/9d59abdc-8ce5-4e8b-90e8-bc4df7a2db47.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f0ec2fd3a00d6659284a60f4407d95a4/2026-11/30d3d598-981a-4e8c-9728-b5bdac479cc2.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0451e9a408cc6e96b9bbaca03feb6637/2026-11/64cd0b22-eada-4e20-adc4-edfef42d1541.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/24005a4ae938e113306bb737bab43389/2026-11/093cf36a-6125-409e-ac2e-8d202a6177ed.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a7345222a5b2de3669b6b79de18c2577/2026-11/1930a476-acfa-4c2b-9a32-b8584b562a88.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1df43dc594e0e81055b8a3d14abb0cb9/2026-11/48381f78-cd5e-4312-a26e-22e49c4ef04e.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9049c804deaa645ef9767cf6ccef0e98/2026-11/69646bf1-1381-4dbb-a705-b6e8a743519c.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d256d144646ade0b1af1cf84d5e0599d/2026-11/adbe6111-9949-4504-87dd-b272ca7a8ef5.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/85dcb7edd25827676e9bc87519ea858f/2026-11/bef5f965-b3b1-458a-b829-fc84884d5b1f.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/81d76581b1313ae65e4839b6733e831a/2026-11/f413fabe-363f-423a-be47-b9a238edbf99.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T12:12:00.800676+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":347,"images":15,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T11:49:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T16:57:51.576592+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T12:05:25.185597+00:00","content_hash":"69570410ad8ca8da855c7f3e72f59b3a0c0eeecf8062391898b4b4e432679d64","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}